  "legal_content_cookie_changes_body": "We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time to reflect changes in technology, regulation, or our use of cookies. When we make material changes, we will update the \"Last Updated\" date at the top of this page. Continued use of the Platform after changes are posted constitutes your acceptance of the revised policy.",
  "legal_content_cookie_changes_title": "Changes to This Cookie Policy",
