  "legal_content_cookie_thirdParty_stripeBefore": "sets cookies for fraud detection and payment session management. See",
  "legal_content_cookie_thirdParty_stripeLinkText": "Stripe's Privacy Policy",
  "legal_content_cookie_thirdParty_supabaseText": "sets authentication cookies to manage your login session on our database infrastructure.",
  "legal_content_cookie_thirdParty_title": "Third-Party Cookies",
  "legal_content_cookie_types_title": "Types of Cookies We Use",
  "legal_content_cookie_whatAreCookies_body": "Cookies are small text files placed on your device when you visit a website. They are widely used to make websites work efficiently, to remember your preferences, and to provide information to website operators. Similar technologies include web beacons, pixels, local storage, and session storage, all of which we refer to collectively as \"cookies\" in this policy.",
  "legal_content_cookie_whatAreCookies_title": "What Are Cookies?",
  "legal_content_cookie_whyWeUse_intro": "CheapestGo uses cookies to:",
  "legal_content_cookie_whyWeUse_title": "Why We Use Cookies",
  "legal_content_privacy_changes_body": "We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we make material changes, we will notify you by email (if you have an account) or by posting a prominent notice on our website. Your continued use of CheapestGo after the effective date of the revised policy constitutes your acceptance of the changes.",
  "legal_content_privacy_changes_title": "Changes to This Policy",
  "legal_content_privacy_childrensPrivacy_body": "CheapestGo is not intended for children under the age of 18. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe we have inadvertently collected information from a child, please contact us immediately at support@cheapestgo.com and we will delete such information promptly.",
  "legal_content_privacy_childrensPrivacy_title": "Children's Privacy",
  "legal_content_privacy_contact_address": "🏢 FORHU Inc. · 30 Wall Street, 8th Floor · New York, NY 10005 · USA",
  "legal_content_privacy_contact_email": "📧 support@cheapestgo.com",
  "legal_content_privacy_contact_intro": "For privacy-related inquiries, requests, or complaints:",
  "legal_content_privacy_contact_title": "Contact Us",
  "legal_content_privacy_cookies_linkText": "Cookie Policy",
  "legal_content_privacy_cookies_textAfter": "for full details on what cookies we use and how to manage your preferences.",
  "legal_content_privacy_cookies_textBefore": "We use cookies and similar technologies to operate our platform and improve your experience. Please see our",
  "legal_content_privacy_cookies_title": "Cookies and Tracking Technologies",
  "legal_content_privacy_dataRetention_intro": "We retain your personal data for as long as necessary to:",
  "legal_content_privacy_dataRetention_note": "When you delete your account, we will delete or anonymize your personal data within 90 days, except where retention is required by law.",
  "legal_content_privacy_dataRetention_title": "Data Retention",
  "legal_content_privacy_howWeShare_intro": "We do not sell your personal information. We share your data only in the following circumstances:",
  "legal_content_privacy_howWeShare_title": "How We Share Your Information",
  "legal_content_privacy_howWeUse_title": "How We Use Your Information",
  "legal_content_privacy_informationWeCollect_autoLabel": "Information collected automatically:",
  "legal_content_privacy_informationWeCollect_directLabel": "Information you provide directly:",
  "legal_content_privacy_informationWeCollect_thirdPartyLabel": "Information from third parties:",
  "legal_content_privacy_informationWeCollect_title": "Information We Collect",
  "legal_content_privacy_internationalTransfers_body": "CheapestGo is headquartered in the United States. When you use our services from Southeast Asia or other regions, your data is transferred to and processed in the United States. We ensure appropriate safeguards are in place for international transfers, including standard contractual clauses where required under applicable law (including GDPR and the Philippine Data Privacy Act of 2012, Republic Act No. 10173).",
  "legal_content_privacy_internationalTransfers_title": "International Data Transfers",
  "legal_content_privacy_security_body": "We implement industry-standard technical and organizational measures to protect your personal data, including encryption in transit (TLS/HTTPS), encryption at rest, access controls, and regular security reviews. Payment data is handled exclusively by Stripe, which is PCI DSS compliant. However, no method of transmission over the internet is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.",
  "legal_content_privacy_security_title": "Security",
  "legal_content_privacy_whoWeAre_para1": "CheapestGo (\"we,\" \"us,\" or \"our\") is an online travel agency operated by FORHU Inc., located at 30 Wall Street, 8th Floor, New York, NY 10005, United States. We provide hotel booking, flight package, and travel deal services primarily to travelers in Southeast Asia through our website and mobile platform.",
  "legal_content_privacy_whoWeAre_para2After": ".",
  "legal_content_privacy_whoWeAre_para2Before": "For questions regarding this Privacy Policy, contact us at",
  "legal_content_privacy_whoWeAre_title": "Who We Are",
  "legal_content_privacy_yourRights_emailAfter": ". We will respond within 30 days.",
  "legal_content_privacy_yourRights_emailBefore": "To exercise any of these rights, email us at",
  "legal_content_privacy_yourRights_intro": "Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the following rights:",
  "legal_content_privacy_yourRights_title": "Your Rights and Choices",
  "legal_content_refund_amendments_intro": "Date changes, room type changes, and guest name corrections are subject to hotel availability and supplier policies. To request an amendment:",
  "legal_content_refund_amendments_noteLabel": "Note:",
  "legal_content_refund_amendments_noteText": "Amendments may result in a price difference (additional charge or credit) and may not always be possible without cancelling and rebooking. We cannot guarantee that amendment requests will be accommodated.",
  "legal_content_refund_amendments_title": "Booking Amendments",
  "legal_content_refund_cancellationTypes_free_body": "You may cancel at no charge before the deadline specified at booking. The exact deadline (e.g., \"Free cancellation until 48 hours before check-in\") is shown on the booking page and in your confirmation email.",
  "legal_content_refund_cancellationTypes_free_heading": "Free Cancellation",
  "legal_content_refund_cancellationTypes_intro": "When you book a hotel through CheapestGo, you will see one of the following rate types:",
  "legal_content_refund_cancellationTypes_nonRefundable_body": "No refund is provided if you cancel. These rates are typically lower in price and are clearly labeled \"Non-refundable\" before checkout.",
  "legal_content_refund_cancellationTypes_nonRefundable_heading": "Non-Refundable",
  "legal_content_refund_cancellationTypes_partial_body": "A partial refund applies depending on when you cancel relative to the check-in date. The penalty amount and cutoff dates are displayed before you confirm payment.",
  "legal_content_refund_cancellationTypes_partial_heading": "Partially Refundable",
  "legal_content_refund_cancellationTypes_title": "Hotel Cancellation Types",
  "legal_content_refund_contact_address": "🏢 FORHU Inc. · 30 Wall Street, 8th Floor · New York, NY 10005 · USA",
  "legal_content_refund_contact_email": "📧 support@cheapestgo.com",
  "legal_content_refund_contact_intro": "For all refund and cancellation queries, please have your booking reference number ready and reach us at:",
  "legal_content_refund_contact_outro": "We aim to respond to all refund requests within 1–2 business days.",
  "legal_content_refund_contact_title": "Contact for Refund Requests",
  "legal_content_refund_disputes_body": "If you have a concern about a charge, please contact us at support@cheapestgo.com before initiating a chargeback with your bank. Most issues can be resolved quickly. Chargebacks initiated without first contacting CheapestGo may result in account suspension. CheapestGo reserves the right to contest chargebacks that are made in bad faith or that do not comply with our cancellation policy.",
  "legal_content_refund_disputes_title": "Disputes and Chargebacks",
  "legal_content_refund_flightPackages_body": "For all-inclusive flight + hotel packages, cancellation terms depend on both the hotel and airline components. Airline tickets are generally non-refundable or carry significant cancellation fees. The specific terms for your package will be shown during checkout and in your confirmation email. If you need to cancel a package, contact us immediately at support@cheapestgo.com for guidance.",
  "legal_content_refund_flightPackages_title": "Flight Packages",
  "legal_content_refund_howToCancel_emailAfter": "with your booking reference number and we will process the cancellation within 1 business day.",
  "legal_content_refund_howToCancel_emailBefore": "Alternatively, contact us at",
  "legal_content_refund_howToCancel_intro": "To cancel a booking:",
  "legal_content_refund_howToCancel_title": "How to Cancel a Booking",
  "legal_content_refund_noShows_body": "If you fail to check in on the scheduled arrival date without cancelling in advance, the booking will be treated as a no-show. No-show policies vary by hotel — most hotels will charge the full booking amount. CheapestGo cannot override hotel no-show policies. We strongly recommend cancelling ahead of time if your plans change.",
  "legal_content_refund_noShows_title": "No-Shows",
  "legal_content_refund_overview_body": "CheapestGo acts as an intermediary between you and travel suppliers (hotels, airlines, and package providers). Cancellation and refund rights are primarily governed by the individual supplier's policies, which vary by property, rate type, and booking dates. This policy explains how we facilitate cancellations and refunds on your behalf.",
  "legal_content_refund_overview_title": "Overview",
  "legal_content_refund_processing_title": "Refund Processing",
  "legal_content_refund_supplierCancellations_intro": "In rare cases, a hotel or travel supplier may cancel your booking due to overbooking, closure, natural disaster, or force majeure events. If this occurs:",
  "legal_content_refund_supplierCancellations_note": "CheapestGo is not liable for losses arising from supplier cancellations, including transportation costs, additional hotel nights booked elsewhere, or consequential losses. We recommend purchasing travel insurance to cover such events.",
  "legal_content_refund_supplierCancellations_title": "Supplier Cancellations and Force Majeure",
  "legal_content_terms_acceptance_body": "By accessing or using the CheapestGo website and services (the \"Platform\"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service (\"Terms\") and all applicable laws and regulations. If you do not agree to these Terms, you may not use the Platform. CheapestGo is operated by FORHU Inc., 30 Wall Street, 8th Floor, New York, NY 10005, United States. These Terms constitute a legally binding agreement between you and CheapestGo.",
  "legal_content_terms_acceptance_title": "Acceptance of Terms",
  "legal_content_terms_accountRegistration_intro": "To access certain features of the Platform, you may need to create an account. You agree to:",
  "legal_content_terms_accountRegistration_note": "CheapestGo reserves the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate these Terms or that are inactive for an extended period.",
  "legal_content_terms_accountRegistration_title": "Account Registration",
  "legal_content_terms_bookingProcess_intro": "When you make a booking through CheapestGo, you are entering into a contract with the travel supplier (hotel, airline, or package provider), not with CheapestGo. CheapestGo acts as an intermediary facilitating the booking.",
  "legal_content_terms_bookingProcess_title": "Booking Process and Confirmation",
  "legal_content_terms_cancellations_refundLinkText": "Refund & Cancellation Policy",
  "legal_content_terms_cancellations_textAfter": ", which is incorporated into these Terms by reference. Please review it carefully before making a booking, as policies vary by hotel and rate type.",
  "legal_content_terms_cancellations_textBefore": "Cancellations and refunds are governed by our",
  "legal_content_terms_cancellations_title": "Cancellations and Refunds",
  "legal_content_terms_changes_body": "CheapestGo reserves the right to modify these Terms at any time. We will notify registered users of material changes via email and by posting an updated version on the Platform with a revised \"Last Updated\" date. Your continued use of the Platform after changes take effect constitutes your acceptance of the revised Terms.",
